irst, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)=\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x).\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {f}^{′}(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) & =\\int \\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\int \\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310895 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310896 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310897 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310898 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310899 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1041 "selection" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1104 #edb/ref 17592186310896 13194139534801 true] [17592186310894 1110 #uuid "d262f556-9b2d-5c2f-9836-2f9a2f032068" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310895 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{3}{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310895 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310895 1111 #uuid "9a5c2e6f-7d51-514e-838e-91d7f32b8ff3" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310896 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310896 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310896 1111 #uuid "db152df6-6469-5361-ada0-24eb57f08be1" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310897 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{9}{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+C" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310897 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310897 1111 #uuid "a3375472-a1ea-529c-a4cf-07d7166322be" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310898 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{9}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+C" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310898 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310898 1111 #uuid "eb44196e-ffb8-57dd-913f-1a8fa4242131" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310899 1034 "f(x)=\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+C" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310899 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310899 1111 #uuid "f50bea76-48ab-5541-9b14-93511273edf3" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1017 #edb/ref 17592186310901 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1089 "q-99009" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1100 "Solve the differential equation $2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=4x.$" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1113 #uuid "99338d6e-762d-5e46-924e-c9b8ff055bcc" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310900 1145 "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int x\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})+\\frac{1}{2}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C \\\\  & ={x}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int ({x}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3})-\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+Cx+D \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+Cx+D.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310902 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310903 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310904 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310905 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310906 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1041 "selection" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1104 #edb/ref 17592186310902 13194139534801 true] [17592186310901 1110 #uuid "8795f23e-fe78-5502-b093-0d5e041c0235" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310902 1034 "y=\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+Cx+D" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310902 1111 #uuid "847a347f-68a4-50ec-9b1e-2f13aab562d9" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310903 1034 "y={x}^{3}-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C+D" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310903 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310903 1111 #uuid "4a295427-fdd4-5410-80af-da95c18694c7" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310904 1034 "y={x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+Cx+D" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310904 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310904 1111 #uuid "ae93cc03-9f50-5b74-8113-d727df0584dc" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310905 1034 "y=\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C+D" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310905 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310905 1111 #uuid "ca064583-e418-5cf0-aa49-199cc524e889" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310906 1034 "y=\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+Cx+D" 13194139534801 true] [17592186310906 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534801 true] [17592186310906 1111 #uuid "08677785-ca3c-598b-8e81-00cb57908329" 13194139534801 true]] :edb/